ViridianCity_Text_CanCarryMonsAnywhere::
    .string "USERBOXes at your waist.\p"
    .string "So you have something running.\p"
    .string "You can carry that anywhere now.\n"
    .string "People forget it was ever hard.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GymClosedWonderWhoLeaderIs::
    .string "This GYM has never once been open.\p"
    .string "Nobody here can tell me who holds\n"
    .string "it.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ViridiansGymLeaderReturned::
    .string "CALLOW GYM's LEADER is back.$"

ViridianCity_Text_WantToKnowAboutCaterpillarMons::
    .string "Do you want the difference between\n"
    .string "CRAWLER and SCRAPER?$"

ViridianCity_Text_OhOkayThen::
    .string "Suit yourself.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ExplainCaterpieWeedle::
    .string "CRAWLER only reads. SCRAPER takes\n"
    .string "what it finds.\p"
    .string "Mind the POISON STING.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GrandpaHasntHadCoffeeYet::
    .string "Grandpa, be nice.\p"
    .string "Sorry. He is not properly awake\n"
    .string "yet.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GoShoppingInPewterOccasionally::
    .string "To shop in SLATE I have to go\n"
    .string "through THE UNDERTONE.\p"
    .string "It is not a short way round.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ThisIsPrivateProperty::
    .string "You are not going through here.\p"
    .string "I own the fence and the field.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ShowYouHowToCatchMons::
    .string "You are carrying an INDEX.\p"
    .string "It writes itself when you bind\n"
    .string "something.\p"
    .string "Do you know how to bind?\p"
    .string "I will show you.$"

ViridianCity_Text_ThatWasEducationalTakeThis::
    .string "There.\p"
    .string "Instructive, was it not?\p"
    .string "Take one of these as well.$"

ViridianCity_Text_WatchThatToLearnBasics::
    .string "Stuck? Watch that.\p"
    .string "It repeats until you have it.$"

ViridianCity_Text_WeakenMonsFirstToCatch::
    .string "Watch. You weaken it, then you\n"
    .string "offer it a box.\p"
    .string "It goes in on its own, or it does\n"
    .string "not go in.$"

ViridianCity_Text_HowsTeachyTVHelping::
    .string "Coffee. Now I can start.\p"
    .string "Too strong. Now I have a\n"
    .string "headache.\p"
    .string "Is that old TEACHY TV any use to\n"
    .string "you?$"

ViridianCity_Text_MyGrandsonOnTheShow::
    .string "That is my grandson presenting.\p"
    .string "He knows less than he sounds like\n"
    .string "he does.\p"
    .string "You will still learn something.$"

ViridianCity_Text_TooBusyForTeachyTV::
    .string "Too busy for TEACHY TV.\p"
    .string "Time is the one thing nobody makes\n"
    .string "more of.$"

ViridianCity_Text_CitySign::
    .string "CALLOW CITY\n"
    .string "Green All Year.\l"
    .string "Untried All Year.$"

ViridianCity_Text_CatchMonsForEasierBattles::
    .string "USER TIPS\p"
    .string "Bind more than you need.\p"
    .string "Every one you hold is one more\n"
    .string "answer available to you.$"

ViridianCity_Text_MovesLimitedByPP::
    .string "USER TIPS\p"
    .string "Every move a daemon has costs\n"
    .string "MANA, shown as MP.\p"
    .string "Rest it at a CHECKPOINT to put the\n"
    .string "MP back.$"

ViridianCity_Text_GymSign::
    .string "CALLOW CITY\n"
    .string "DAEMON GYM$"

ViridianCity_Text_GymDoorsAreLocked::
    .string "CALLOW GYM is locked.\p"
    .string "It has been for some time.$"

